{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_04_beg","storyGroup":"act45side","storySort":8,"storyDependence":"act45side_level_act45side_03_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"SS-4","storyName":"名为客房区的迷宫","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"在初华的梦境中，祥子乘船前往了一座人烟稀少的小岛，并发现初华在梦境中孤独地等待了她许多年。另一边，初华因为刚结识的朋友艾雅法拉的疑问，不得不正视自己的感情。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act45side/level_act45side_04_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act45side_04","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":6,"next":8,"characters":["热心的船夫","丰川祥子","？？？","？？","艾雅法拉","三角初华","疑惑的岛民","同样疑惑的岛民","不再疑惑的岛民","同样不再疑惑的岛民","莫菲丝","沃尔夫"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E4/Avg_bg_65_g10_dreamcastlestage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":8},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>包裹住最脆弱柔软的记忆，直至无人知晓。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":10},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>可声嘶力竭的呐喊，又如何让那人听见？</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":11},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>我，毋畏悲伤。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":12},{"type":"subtitle","id":13},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":15},{"type":"dialog","id":16},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":17},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":18},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":19},{"type":"charslot","id":20},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0C/Avg_bg_65_g3_islandharbor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":21},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":22},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":23,"musicid":1},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_harbor_busy","volume":"1","id":24},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shipwhistle","volume":"1","delay":"0.5","id":25},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":26},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":27},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footstep_stonestep","volume":"0.6","channel":"step","loop":"false","id":28},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step","fadetime":"2.5","id":29},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstpwalk","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"o","id":30},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"o","fadetime":"3","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":32},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":34},{"type":"charslot","id":35},{"type":"text","text":"从摇摇晃晃的甲板走上坚硬的土地，重新脚踏实地的感觉让祥子有些安心。","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热心的船夫","text":"姑娘，谢谢你一直陪我聊天。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热心的船夫","text":"这岛离陆地实在太远，要是没你，我一个人盯着海面开船，准无聊疯了。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"和您聊天，也让我听到了许多海上的趣事。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热心的船夫","text":"你这装扮看起来也不像是本地人，你怎么会来这种无人问津的小岛？","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"r","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......有一个想找的人。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热心的船夫","text":"她是本地人？","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"r","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......应该不是。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热心的船夫","text":"那真是稀奇了，这岛上只有往外面跑的，从没见过主动来的。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"r","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"其实我也不能确定她在不在这......","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":56},{"type":"text","text":"祥子手中只有这张前往小岛的船票，不论是不是莫菲丝的恶作剧，她都只有这一个选择。","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"l","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":60},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_slapcloth_light","volume":"1","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热心的船夫","text":"（拍肩）哎，没事的！这岛上就这么点人，问问住在这的居民，肯定很快就能找到的！","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......嗯。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热心的船夫","text":"不过姑娘，不管最后找没找到，你过了正午一定要回到这啊。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热心的船夫","text":"这里的船班次实在太少，你要是错过，至少得等下个月才能离开了。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"r","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"可现在已经快......","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热心的船夫","text":"唉，这也没办法啊。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热心的船夫","text":"我也能多等你一会，但晚上出航不安全，咱们日落前一定得返航。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"r","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......那我现在就出发！","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":75},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":76},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":77},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.3","fadetime":"2","id":78},{"type":"charslot","id":79},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":80},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":81},{"type":"playsound","key":"$beach","channel":"bc","loop":"true","volume":"0.5","id":82},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"（大声）哆——来——咪——","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？","text":"嗯，能听见。","id":86},{"type":"dialog","id":87},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fssand","channel":"ystep","loop":"true","volume":"0.5","id":88},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"ystep","fadetime":"3","id":89},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"（小声）哆——来——咪——","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？","text":"......","id":92},{"type":"dialog","id":93},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":94},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"我刚刚在远处重复了一遍......是听不见了吗？","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？","text":"......嗯。刚刚，没有声音。","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......我先帮你把眼罩摘下来吧。","id":98},{"type":"dialog","id":99},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":100},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":101},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bc","fadetime":"1.5","id":102},{"type":"charslot","id":103},{"type":"largebg","imagegroup":"bg_beach_1/bg_beach_2","solidwidth":"920/920","solidheight":"720","x":"-180","id":104},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":105},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_dim_openeye","layer":"1","id":106},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":107},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":108},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":109},{"type":"bgeffect","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#9$2","duration":"0.7","id":112},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"结果怎么样？","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#9$2","focus":"r","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"不容乐观......和上次比起来，又近了一些。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C7/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"这样吗......我知道了。以后外出考察，我会多注意周围状况的。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#11$2","focus":"r","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"艾雅法拉，你该多为自己的安全着想。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"你来岛上有多久了？","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"两个月前到的岛上。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#11$2","focus":"r","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"你听力的情况一直在恶化，但这里没有正规的医生能给予你帮助。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"今天码头应该有航船停靠，我帮你收拾行李，你待会就启程回去。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"不行，这里的火山还有最后一组数据没收集完......","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7F/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#9$2","focus":"r","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"可是你的身体——","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C7/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"来这个小岛前，我请罗德岛的医生帮我做了健康评估。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"嗯......情况的确不容乐观，但我和医生做了保证，三个月内一定会回去。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"医生她知道火山研究对我来说很重要，所以最后还是同意让我来了。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#9$2","focus":"r","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"......","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C7/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#13$1","focus":"l","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"初华小姐，我喜欢火山，就和你喜欢星星一样。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"我们最开始的相遇，不就是那晚我在山上迷了路，然后遇见了正好在看星空的你吗？","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#13$2","focus":"r","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"......你之后去山上考察，记得叫上我一起。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"嗯，没问题！","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":145},{"type":"charslot","id":146},{"type":"playsound","key":"$beach","channel":"bc1","loop":"true","volume":"1","id":147},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bc1","fadetime":"3.5","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"早晨的天气真好呀......","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"初华小姐，我能听你唱首歌吗？","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"感觉这个天气，很适合听着歌，眺望远处的火山和大海。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#13$2","focus":"r","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"嗯，那我凑近一点......","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":157},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-120,0","duration":"1","id":158},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":159},{"type":"text","text":"初华稍微拉近了两人的距离，她看见艾雅法拉小小的耳朵正在竖起，里面的助听器也露了出来。","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#3$2","focus":"r","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"（深吸气）","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":163},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":164},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":165},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":166},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":167},{"type":"sticker","id":168,"multi":"true","text":"“描绘扭曲天空，我不禁去遐想”","x":"300","y":"200","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":169,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“愿无羽翼的你，堕临至我身旁”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":170,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“我不幸触碰了，神圣高洁之物”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":171,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“只求你在今夜，成为我的神话——”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":172,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“......”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":173},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":174},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":175},{"type":"dialog","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":177},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clapsologirl","id":178},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"真好听呀！","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"......谢谢。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"这首歌是谁写的？我好像在其他地方从没有听过，难道是岛上的音乐？","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#8$1","focus":"n","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"我也不知道。可能是以前听过的某首歌吧，无意间就记住了......","id":186},{"type":"dialog","id":187},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"可是，初华小姐......你现在好像很悲伤。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":191},{"type":"charslot","id":192},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#8$2","duration":"1","id":194},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"欸......？","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C7/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":198},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":199},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":200},{"type":"charslot","id":201},{"type":"largebg","id":202},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_bg_41_g5_siestaunbuiltland_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":203},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":204},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":205,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":206},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_021","focus":"m","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的岛民","text":"嗯？三角初华？","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_021.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的岛民","text":"约翰，你听说过这个名字吗？","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_021.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1002_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"同样疑惑的岛民","text":"没印象。这名字一听就是岛外人吧？","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_1002_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"大叔，能不能麻烦您再想想？","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我听附近的老奶奶说，您在岛上的人缘最好，认识的人最多，肯定能给出一些线索......","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_021","focus":"m","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的岛民","text":"唉......可这岛上就这么点人，我们都没听说过的人，应该是新来的吧？","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_021.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的岛民","text":"欸，之前不是说，火山的背面有栋别墅，里面住着一个怪人？","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_021.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1002_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"同样疑惑的岛民","text":"嗯......好像是有这么个人。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_1002_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"同样疑惑的岛民","text":"虽然想不起具体的名字，但感觉只有可能是她了吧。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_1002_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"那她现在在哪？！","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_021","focus":"m","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不再疑惑的岛民","text":"喏，沿着环岛公路往北二十公里，绕到山的背面你就能看到那栋别墅了。","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_021.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"好的。二十公里，开车的话大概半小时......","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_021","focus":"m","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不再疑惑的岛民","text":"啊，这里没有车。","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_021.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"没有车？！","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1002_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"同样不再疑惑的岛民","text":"你刚才来的时候没注意到吗，咱岛上哪来的车？","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_1002_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"但是，明明道路都维护得很好......","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_021","focus":"m","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不再疑惑的岛民","text":"那是以前想吸引岛外人来旅游嘛，结果没想到修完没有人来，反而更穷了。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_021.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不再疑惑的岛民","text":"小姑娘，你要是赶时间的话，这辆单车借给你吧。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_021.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不再疑惑的岛民","text":"成色的确不新，但还是能凑合着用的。你蹬得快点的话，两小时差不多能到。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_021.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":242},{"type":"charslot","id":243},{"type":"text","text":"祥子看向了大叔身后那辆老旧的单车，车身破破烂烂，上面印着的图案也已经掉落了许多，一切似乎都在诉说着它的饱经风霜。","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1002_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"同样不再疑惑的岛民","text":"加油！好久没看到新面孔了，祝你顺利找到那个人，以及在岛上玩得开心！","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_1002_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"谢谢你老先生，那么我就先走了。","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F2/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":249},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.7","id":250},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":251},{"type":"text","text":"祥子轻轻蹬下踏板——","id":252},{"type":"dialog","id":253},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bicyclegallop","volume":"0.8","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":254},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2.5","id":255},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":256},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":257},{"type":"multiline","name":"丰川祥子","text":"这车......只要能动起来......","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":259},{"type":"multiline","name":"丰川祥子","text":"没问题！","id":260},{"type":"dialog","id":261},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":262},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_021","focus":"m","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不再疑惑的岛民","text":"小心点，你前面是下坡路——","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_021.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":266},{"type":"charslot","id":267},{"type":"text","text":"提醒总是迟来一步，少女已经和老旧的单车一起失控地冲了下去。","id":268},{"type":"dialog","id":269},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_electrcwhlchrrll","volume":"0.8","id":270},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":271},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":272},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"啊啊————————！","id":274},{"type":"dialog","id":275},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_021","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不再疑惑的岛民","text":"......很有趣吧？","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_021.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_021","focus":"m","id":280},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_021","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":282},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":283},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humanchange","id":284},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#19$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":285},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":286},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#19$1","focus":"m","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈......","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-19$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"实在是——太好笑了！哈哈哈哈哈哈！","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-19$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1938_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃尔夫","text":"莫、莫菲丝。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_1938_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃尔夫","text":"我，觉得，有点，过火......","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_1938_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"闭嘴。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1938_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃尔夫","text":"......","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_1938_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"这是她自己同意的赌局，我只是遵守我们之间的赌约。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"我一定会找到她的弱点，然后为她编织一个永不醒来的梦境。","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"multiline","name":"莫菲丝","text":"她会明白的——","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":301},{"type":"multiline","name":"莫菲丝","text":"我就是梦城堡最好的“造梦师”。","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"......爱丽丝，那个家伙，她不可能强过我。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":304},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":305},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":306},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":307},{"type":"charslot","id":308},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_bg_53_g16_sunnyday_R1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":309},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":310},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":311,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":312},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"太阳升到头顶，树荫越来越少了......","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"感觉有些热起来了。","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"我的住处离这很近，不如去我那里坐坐吧？","id":316},{"type":"dialog","id":317},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":318},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":319},{"type":"charslot","id":320},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_bg_34_g6_noblelivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":321},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":322},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":323},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":324},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#8$1","duration":"0.7","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#1$2","duration":"0.7","id":326},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":327},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"唔——真的一下子就凉快下来了！","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"这个客厅真的好大——这么空旷的房间，冬天应该很冷吧？","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"点燃那边的壁炉，屋子很快会变得暖和起来。","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"不过我一个人的话，拿个小炉子放在沙发旁就完全够用啦。","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"唔，我没想到你原来是大小姐......","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1E/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#14$2","focus":"r","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"你好像误会了什么。我不是什么大小姐，我只是这里的管家。","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"（小声）我会不会吵到房子的主人......？","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#13$2","focus":"r","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"没关系的啦，现在这里只有我一个人住。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#9$2","focus":"r","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"这栋房子的主人......已经很久没回来过了。","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C7/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"听起来......你很想念她的样子。","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#12$2","focus":"r","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"嗯，比起主仆，我们的关系可能更特别一些......","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A2/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#12$2","focus":"r","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"她是第一个把目光放在我身上的人，之后也成了我的第一位挚友。","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A2/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"她喜欢弹钢琴，我就坐在旁边的椅子上，为她伴唱和声。","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A2/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"一开始，我们真的很开心......很开心。","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A2/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"可是，她为什么会离开呢？离开这座小岛，离开这个......“家”？","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7F/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":354},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#12$2","focus":"r","id":355},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#9$2","focus":"r","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"为什么呢......难道说，想留在这里的，从来都只有我一个人吗？","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C7/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":359},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0","fadetime":"1","id":360},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":361},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":362},{"type":"charslot","id":363},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_bg_41_g5_siestaunbuiltland_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":364},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":365},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_speedline","layer":"1","id":366},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bicyclegallop","loop":"true","channel":"bse","volume":"0","id":367},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.8","fadetime":"1.5","channel":"bse","id":368},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":369},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":370},{"type":"text","text":"单车的吱呀声越来越刺耳，平衡也越来越难以控制。","id":371},{"type":"text","text":"更糟糕的是，体力已经渐渐不支。","id":372},{"type":"dialog","id":373},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hastybell","volume":"1","id":374},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":375},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"啊——！","id":377},{"type":"text","text":"急转弯处，单车突然失去了控制，祥子被惯性甩了出去。","id":378},{"type":"dialog","id":379},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bse","fadetime":"0.5","id":380},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":381},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"35","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":382},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":383},{"type":"bgeffect","id":384},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"1","id":385},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":386},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":387},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothtrailground","volume":"1","id":388},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$2","duration":"1","id":389},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"唔......","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D0/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":393},{"type":"charslot","id":394},{"type":"text","text":"强忍着疼痛，她支撑起身体，努力抬头看向目的地。","id":395},{"type":"text","text":"遥远的山脚下，依稀能看见一栋房子。","id":396},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"那是......","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":399},{"type":"text","text":"看着那栋房子，没来由地，无数陌生的回忆在祥子脑海中浮现——","id":400},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"1.5","id":401},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"那、那是——","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":404},{"type":"charslot","id":405},{"type":"text","text":"在初华的梦里，儿时的祥子和初华在那里玩耍。","id":406},{"type":"text","text":"长大后，她们一起在那里生活。","id":407},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"这些......都是初华的梦吗？","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":410},{"type":"charslot","id":411},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstpwalk","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"o","id":412},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"o","fadetime":"2","id":413},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":414},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","duration":"0.7","id":415},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":416},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#20$1","focus":"m","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"哼哼——♪哼哼哼——♪","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F1/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"嗯......怎么样，托我的福，你应该也能看到了吧？","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F1/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"我的确给她创造了很多美妙的梦，但这个叫初华的孩子，最大的愿望就是跟你在一起呢。","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F1/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"只是梦的最后，她都是独自一人。","id":422,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"每次的结局都是你不受掌控，然后突然消失——","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"丰川祥子，你可真是个残酷的人。","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我......残酷......","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你不是听那个家伙说过吗？","id":428,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"梦是人内心深处最真实的想法。而在三角初华的心里——她越是渴望和你在一起，越是无法触及你。","id":429,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"就算创造了一个渺无人烟的小岛，就算这里只有你和她，她也只能一次又一次地体会获得后又失去的痛苦。","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"她那小小的幸福，总会像流沙一样从指尖溜走。","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"啧啧，一个人的内心该是有多绝望，才会连梦境都无法挽救呀。","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......初华，我会把你从噩梦里拉出来。","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#19$1","focus":"m","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"真的吗？真的吗？！","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-19$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#21$1","focus":"m","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"那我就期待一下——期待一下你无能为力、恼羞成怒的表情吧！","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-21$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":439},{"type":"charslot","id":440},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shipwhistle","volume":"1","id":441},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":442},{"type":"text","text":"就在莫菲丝肆无忌惮地狂笑时，远处传来了一阵船舶的鸣笛。","id":443},{"type":"text","text":"那是它即将返航的信号。","id":444},{"type":"dialog","id":445},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":446},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":447},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":448},{"type":"image","id":449},{"type":"charslot","id":450}],"characters":["热心的船夫","丰川祥子","？？？","？？","艾雅法拉","三角初华","疑惑的岛民","同样疑惑的岛民","不再疑惑的岛民","同样不再疑惑的岛民","莫菲丝","沃尔夫"]}